        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Acute left-sided lumbar pain for approximately 10/7, onset after lifting heavy stock boxes at work. Initially a sharp twinge, now a constant dull ache rated 4/10 at baseline, with intermittent sharper pain rated 7–8/10 on flexion, twisting, or rolling in bed. Localised to the left lumbar region, with no radiation below the knee."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back pain-related function"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pain affects ability to complete full work shifts; patient needs to sit more and avoids heavier lifting."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported back pain red flags"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports no leg weakness, numbness, paraesthesia, saddle anaesthesia, bowel or bladder incontinence, urinary retention, trauma or fall, fever, weight loss, or history of IVDU or malignancy."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
