        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and mobility"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mobilises independently; mildly uncomfortable, especially when moving."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back inspection"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No deformity, bruising, or swelling."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back palpation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Localised tenderness to palpation of the left paraspinal muscles at approximately L3–L5, with increased tone/spasm. No midline bony tenderness."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Flexion and extension mildly reduced due to pain. Left side flexion reproduces pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lower limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Power 5/5 at hips, knees, and ankles bilaterally. Patellar and Achilles reflexes 2+ and symmetrical. Light touch and pin sensation intact from L2–S1. Straight leg raise negative bilaterally. Gait normal; heel and toe walking intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
